WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:06.995
Learn to partition the 0 to 1 number line into equal unit fractions and recognise and

00:00:06.995 --> 00:00:11.241
name equivalent fractions using pictorial representations and number line to

00:00:11.241 --> 00:00:13.789
determine the lowest common denominator (lcd)

00:00:14.617 --> 00:00:21.125
A number line from 0 to 1 is divided into 6 equal parts. What fraction is at mark 4

00:00:21.125 --> 00:00:26.606
after zero? The answer is 4/6. Each tick is one 6th, so mark 4 is 4/6.

00:00:27.450 --> 00:00:32.677
A measuring strip is divided into 8 equal sections. 4 are coloured. What fraction is

00:00:32.677 --> 00:00:35.813
coloured? Pause and solve it in your exercise book.

00:00:36.617 --> 00:00:39.902
The answer is 4/8. 4 parts out of 8.
